{"route":"/docs/5.2/helpers/color-background/","version":"5.2","renderedVersion":"5.2","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Color &amp; background","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Set a background color with contrasting foreground color."},"blocks":[{"id":"overview","type":"heading","en":"Overview","level":2},{"id":"overview--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<small>Added in v5.2.0</small>"},{"id":"overview--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Color and background helpers combine the power of our <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.2/utilities/colors/\"><code>.text-*</code> utilities</a> and <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.2/utilities/background/\"><code>.bg-*</code> utilities</a> in one class. Using our Sass <code>color-contrast()</code> function, we automatically determine a contrasting <code>color</code> for a particular <code>background-color</code>."},{"id":"overview--note-1","type":"note","tone":"warning","body":[{"id":"overview--note-text-1","type":"note-text","en":"<strong>Heads up!</strong> There’s currently no support for a CSS-native <code>color-contrast</code> function, so we use our own via Sass. This means that customizing our theme colors via CSS variables may cause color contrast issues with these utilities."}]},{"id":"overview--example-1","type":"demo","key":"ac0b2ef9c2128ef32a48","height":300},{"id":"overview--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"text-bg-primary p-3\">Primary with contrasting color</div>\n<div class=\"text-bg-secondary p-3\">Secondary with contrasting color</div>\n<div class=\"text-bg-success p-3\">Success with contrasting color</div>\n<div class=\"text-bg-danger p-3\">Danger with contrasting color</div>\n<div class=\"text-bg-warning p-3\">Warning with contrasting color</div>\n<div class=\"text-bg-info p-3\">Info with contrasting color</div>\n<div class=\"text-bg-light p-3\">Light with contrasting color</div>\n<div class=\"text-bg-dark p-3\">Dark with contrasting color</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"with-components","type":"heading","en":"With components","level":2},{"id":"with-components--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Use them in place of combined <code>.text-*</code> and <code>.bg-*</code> classes, like on <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.2/components/badge/#background-colors\">badges</a>:"},{"id":"with-components--example-1","type":"demo","key":"df466e88b4bbbf7965ba","height":174},{"id":"with-components--code-1","type":"code","value":"<span class=\"badge text-bg-primary\">Primary</span>\n<span class=\"badge text-bg-info\">Info</span>","language":"html"},{"id":"with-components--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Or on <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.2/components/card/#background-and-color\">cards</a>:"},{"id":"with-components--example-2","type":"demo","key":"8568cb1746b666a29dae","height":174},{"id":"with-components--code-2","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"card text-bg-primary mb-3\" style=\"max-width: 18rem;\">\n  <div class=\"card-header\">Header</div>\n  <div class=\"card-body\">\n    <p class=\"card-text\">Some quick example text to build on the card title and make up the bulk of the card's content.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"card text-bg-info mb-3\" style=\"max-width: 18rem;\">\n  <div class=\"card-header\">Header</div>\n  <div class=\"card-body\">\n    <p class=\"card-text\">Some quick example text to build on the card title and make up the bulk of the card's content.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>","language":"html"}],"demos":[{"key":"ac0b2ef9c2128ef32a48","html":"\n\n<div class=\"text-bg-primary p-3\">Primary with contrasting color</div>\n<div class=\"text-bg-secondary p-3\">Secondary with contrasting color</div>\n<div class=\"text-bg-success p-3\">Success with contrasting color</div>\n<div class=\"text-bg-danger p-3\">Danger with contrasting color</div>\n<div class=\"text-bg-warning p-3\">Warning with contrasting color</div>\n<div class=\"text-bg-info p-3\">Info with contrasting color</div>\n<div class=\"text-bg-light p-3\">Light with contrasting color</div>\n<div class=\"text-bg-dark p-3\">Dark with contrasting color</div>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"df466e88b4bbbf7965ba","html":"\n<span class=\"badge text-bg-primary\">Primary</span>\n<span class=\"badge text-bg-info\">Info</span>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"8568cb1746b666a29dae","html":"\n<div class=\"card text-bg-primary mb-3\" style=\"max-width: 18rem;\">\n  <div class=\"card-header\">Header</div>\n  <div class=\"card-body\">\n    <p class=\"card-text\">Some quick example text to build on the card title and make up the bulk of the card's content.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"card text-bg-info mb-3\" style=\"max-width: 18rem;\">\n  <div class=\"card-header\">Header</div>\n  <div class=\"card-body\">\n    <p class=\"card-text\">Some quick example text to build on the card title and make up the bulk of the card's content.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""}],"nav":[{"en":"Introduction","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.2/getting-started/introduction/"},{"en":"Download","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.2/getting-started/download/"},{"en":"Contents","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.2/getting-started/contents/"},{"en":"Browsers & devices","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.2/getting-started/browsers-devices/"},{"en":"JavaScript","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.2/getting-started/javascript/"},{"en":"Webpack","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.2/getting-started/webpack/"},{"en":"Parcel","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.2/getting-started/parcel/"},{"en":"Vite","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.2/getting-started/vite/"},{"en":"Accessibility","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.2/getting-started/accessibility/"},{"en":"RFS","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.2/getting-started/rfs/"},{"en":"RTL","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.2